{"id":"quarenta","lemma":"quarenta","pos":"noun","rank":3308,"glosses":["forty"],"ipa":"/kwaˈɾẽ.tɐ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"quarentas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/11/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-quarenta.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tenho quarenta anos.","en":"I'm forty years old.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/763811","words":[{"g":"have","l":"ter"},null,{"g":"year","l":"ano"}]},{"text":"Quarenta anos se passaram.","en":"Forty years passed.","words":[null,{"g":"year","l":"ano"},{"g":"if / oneself"},null]},{"text":"Há quarenta alunos na nossa classe.","en":"There are forty students in our class.","words":[{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},null,{"g":"student","l":"aluno"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"oh, my God!"},{"g":"class, kind"}]},{"text":"Comprei quarenta dólares de gasolina hoje.","en":"I bought forty dollars' worth of gasoline today.","words":[{"g":"to buy","l":"comprar"},null,{"g":"dollar","l":"dólar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"petrol / gasoline"},{"g":"today"}]},{"text":"Ele tem mais de quarenta.","en":"He's over forty.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"more than"]]}]}